00:02:15.414 --> 00:02:17.121
And when my son was eight months old,

00:02:17.121 --> 00:02:20.844
I went to the ATM to get $20 out the bank

00:02:20.844 --> 00:02:22.881
because I didn't have any Pampers for him.

00:02:22.881 --> 00:02:27.048
And in order to get $20
out, you got to have $20 in.

00:02:27.944 --> 00:02:29.027
I had $11.42.

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:33.667
And I still can't tell the
story without getting emotional

00:02:33.667 --> 00:02:35.291
