transform your life.

00:03:33.167 --> 00:03:36.083
"Because you didn't ask
to come into this chaos."

00:03:36.083 --> 00:03:38.572
As an African-American male child

00:03:38.572 --> 00:03:40.493
in South-Central Los Angelos,

00:03:40.493 --> 00:03:43.191
with a single mother
whose father's in prison,

00:03:43.191 --> 00:03:47.275
he had a 66% chance of
going to prison himself.

00:03:47.275 --> 00:03:48.608
Not on my watch.

00:03:49.557 --> 00:03:51.416
Not on my watch.

00:03:51.416 --> 00:03:54.559
So if I have to be willing to
drastically transform myself

00:03:54.559 --> 00:03:58.762
so that I can become the
woman that I know I can be.

00:03:58.762 --> 00:04:00.545
And that's what I began to do.

00:04:00.545 --> 00:04:01.734
I was radical.

00:04:01.734 --> 00:04:03.271
- What did you do, Lisa?

00:04:03.271 --> 00:04:06.429
What did you do to change your life?

00:04:06.429 --> 00:04:10.846
- First, I realized I
couldn't grow with people

00:04:10.846 --> 00:04:13.012
who were struggling like me.

00:04:13.012 --> 00:04:15.601
That whole I don't want
to leave nobody behind?

00:04:15.601 --> 00:04:17.216
No, I don't want to stay with ya'll.

00:04:17.216 --> 00:04:20.241
You don't even want to be here.

00:04:20.241 --> 00:04:23.682
I don't want to be the
queen of this block.

00:04:23.682 --> 00:04:26.206
And I became okay with the fact

00:04:26.206 --> 00:04:29.605
that it doesn't make me any
less committed to my community,

00:04:29.605 --> 00:04:32.349
committed to my coacher,
committed to my family.

00:04:32.349 --> 00:04:35.818
The best thing I can do for
you is not stay here with you.

00:04:35.818 --> 00:04:39.156
When I've got that, I went to
places I'd never seen before.

00:04:39.156 --> 00:04:41.731
I went to conferences where
people were talking about money,

00:04:41.731 --> 00:04:43.717
talking about prosperity, talking about

00:04:43.717 --> 00:04:46.788
it was like no hablo espanol,
whacha all talking about?

00:04:46.788 --> 00:04:48.940
ROIs, and PPMs, and term aggrements,

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:52.985
and capital fundraising and
bottom lines, and what is?

00:04:52.985 --> 00:04:55.938
Imma stay until I learn
what you're talking about.

00:04:55.938 --> 00:04:59.188
I went to the same conference 42 times.

00:05:00.176 --> 00:05:03.892
And there I raised $532,000 in capital

00:05:03.892 --> 00:05:05.791
for my company to start my dream.

00:05:05.791 --> 00:05:08.170
And my dream was to transform teen lives.

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:10.040
I want to teach teens
how to fall madly in love

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:12.791
