make integrity based decisions.

00:05:12.791 --> 00:05:14.873
And I got it funded,
and I started working.

00:05:14.873 --> 00:05:18.229
And that was the beginning
of me rescuing myself.

00:05:18.229 --> 00:05:20.910
I realized that I am my rescue.

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:24.327
No one else is my rescue, I am my rescue.

00:05:25.257 --> 00:05:26.902
So I was hungry.

00:05:26.902 --> 00:05:27.999
Like, I was hungry.

00:05:27.999 --> 00:05:31.257
People often want to
call me the exception,

00:05:31.257 --> 00:05:32.797
like, "Oh my gosh, you're the exception."

00:05:32.797 --> 00:05:33.998
No, I'm not the exception.

00:05:33.998 --> 00:05:36.972
I'm an average ordinary
woman who chose every day

00:05:36.972 --> 00:05:39.830
to make one more extraordinary decision.

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:42.183
I'm an average ordinary mom,

00:05:42.183 --> 00:05:46.223
who said I want to drastically
transform my son's future.

00:05:46.223 --> 00:05:48.751
That he deserves to have ever option

00:05:48.751 --> 00:05:50.473
that every other child would have,

00:05:50.473 --> 00:05:52.439
irregardless of what he was born into.

00:05:52.439 --> 00:05:55.246
I just was crazy enough to believe that.

00:05:55.246 --> 00:05:57.381
That it doesn't matter
the color of my skin,

00:05:57.381 --> 00:05:58.932
doesn't matter my religious background,

00:05:58.932 --> 00:06:00.273
doesn't matter my origin,

00:06:00.273 --> 00:06:02.176
it doesn't matter my mom's bank account

00:06:02.176 --> 00:06:03.807
