00:23:40.692 --> 00:23:42.409
- You won't ever attract more money to you

00:23:42.409 --> 00:23:44.911
until you become a even greater steward

00:23:44.911 --> 00:23:46.948
of the money that you have.

00:23:46.948 --> 00:23:50.075
That when you mind your
pennies, dollars will flow.

00:23:50.075 --> 00:23:52.365
But if you are currently
not the best steward

00:23:52.365 --> 00:23:54.692
of the money that you have,
meaning that you spend it fast,

00:23:54.692 --> 00:23:57.543
you give it away, you don't
know how much you have,

00:23:57.543 --> 00:23:58.958
then it's difficult for the universe

00:23:58.958 --> 00:24:02.071
to give you more of what
you're not taking total

00:24:02.071 --> 00:24:04.677
and the highest level of
responsibility around.

00:24:04.677 --> 00:24:05.909
That's an ouch, but it's the truth.

00:24:05.909 --> 00:24:07.964
I kept wanting to make more money,

00:24:07.964 --> 00:24:10.833
but I wasn't minding the
money I was making right.

00:24:10.833 --> 00:24:14.124
Because my mother used to
say money burns our pockets.

00:24:14.124 --> 00:24:17.203
So I thought money was hot
and I had to spend it fast.

00:24:17.203 --> 00:24:20.142
And once I learned how to
mind my existing money,

00:24:20.142 --> 00:24:22.275
all of the sudden, I begin to have space

00:24:22.275 --> 00:24:24.487
to attract more money in my space.

00:24:24.487 --> 00:24:26.830
So being a good steward
of your existing dollars

00:24:26.830 --> 00:24:28.340
are very very important

00:24:28.340 --> 00:24:32.173
because that will bring
about more prosperity.

00:24:33.629 --> 00:24:35.885
You have to recognize,
and this is the part

00:24:35.885 --> 00:24:38.272
where people resist, they come
to me for help all the time.

00:24:38.272 --> 00:24:40.426
Okay great, let's find
out what's in break down.

00:24:40.426 --> 00:24:43.229
I'm cool, I just need to get back,

00:24:43.229 --> 00:24:44.157
no something's in break down.

00:24:44.157 --> 00:24:46.321
A breakdown doesn't mean
you need a wide jack

00:24:46.321 --> 00:24:47.984
and you on the floor, it
means something in my life

00:24:47.984 --> 00:24:49.565
isn't the exact way I want it.

00:24:49.565 --> 00:24:50.831
We always have breakdown,

00:24:50.831 --> 00:24:52.311
it's just how we manage our breakdown.

00:24:52.311 --> 00:24:54.945
So the number one thing is to
be authentic and transparent

00:24:54.945 --> 00:24:56.516
about what's not working.

00:24:56.516 --> 00:24:59.121
Even in your grandeur,
something ain't working.

00:24:59.121 --> 00:25:03.925
The reality is somebody lost
40 pounds and I found it.

00:25:03.925 --> 00:25:06.557
And I'm trying to return
it to it's rightful owner.

00:25:06.557 --> 00:25:08.159
(laughter)

00:25:08.159 --> 00:25:09.509
I'm just saying.

00:25:09.509 --> 00:25:11.542
So that's what I'm working on right now.

00:25:11.542 --> 00:25:13.688
The best thing I can do is
be honest out loud about it.

00:25:13.688 --> 00:25:16.033
We try to protect and hide too much.

00:25:16.033 --> 00:25:18.030
We try to defend and protect too much.

00:25:18.030 --> 00:25:20.042
We live in proving, so
first thing I get them to do

00:25:20.042 --> 00:25:22.148
is what are you hiding,
protecting, proving, or defending?

00:25:22.148 --> 00:25:23.470
Let's identify that.

00:25:23.470 --> 00:25:25.223
Now what's the distance between that

00:25:25.223 --> 00:25:26.641
and where you want to
be, and then the rest is

00:25:26.641 --> 00:25:29.673
are you willing to do something
you've never done before?

00:25:29.673 --> 00:25:30.785
Most people don't.

00:25:30.785 --> 00:25:33.634
They want to have a grander
life, a more exciting life,

00:25:33.634 --> 00:25:35.191
doing exactly what they were doing.

00:25:35.191 --> 00:25:38.696
See my grandmother said
that conviction and comfort

00:25:38.696 --> 00:25:41.010
don't live in the same block.

00:25:41.010 --> 00:25:42.976
If you going to be
convicted about something,

00:25:42.976 --> 00:25:44.972
you might have to go
through some discomfort.

00:25:44.972 --> 00:25:46.264
But if you want to stay comfortable,

00:25:46.264 --> 00:25:47.830
why don't you just relax where you are,

00:25:47.830 --> 00:25:49.119
because that's where you're going to stay.

00:25:49.119 --> 00:25:52.136
And so are you willing
to reinvent who you are?

00:25:52.136 --> 00:25:54.483
Are you willing to kill
away the procrastination?

00:25:54.483 --> 00:25:56.912
Are you willing to kill away
the excuses, the blame game?

00:25:56.912 --> 00:26:00.439
I never let people call me
a single mom by my title.

00:26:00.439 --> 00:26:05.022
I'm Lisa Nichols who happens
to be a single mother.

00:26:05.022 --> 00:26:07.296
Don't define me by my circumstances,

00:26:07.296 --> 00:26:09.172
define me by my intention.

00:26:09.172 --> 00:26:10.879
So it's just really being willing.

00:26:10.879 --> 00:26:12.782
Most change will happen here first.

00:26:12.782 --> 00:26:14.045
And if you don't change there,

00:26:14.045 --> 00:26:16.012
you can win the lotto
and still end up broke,

00:26:16.012 --> 00:26:17.921
because you're going to slingshot back

00:26:17.921 --> 00:26:19.374
to your mental comfort zone.

00:26:19.374 --> 00:26:20.207
- [Steve] Most people do.

